  "description": "RoutesList is a powerful .NET tool for visualizing and analyzing all routes in your application with clarity and precision.\n      \n      Key Features:\n      • Comprehensive inspection of HTTP methods, URIs, controllers, actions, middleware and routing configurations\n      • Customizable output formats for flexible integration\n      • Detailed filtering options to focus on specific routes\n      • Complete route information display for debugging and documentation\n      \n      Compatible with .NET Core 3.1, .NET 5.0, .NET 6.0, .NET 7.0, .NET 8.0, .NET 9.0 and supports Razor Pages, ASP.NET MVC, and Blazor Server applications.",
